          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઠગ (ṭhag) comes from ṭhagg, \"to cheat\", a form CDIAL reconstructs, and CDIAL lists the Gujarati noun (CDIAL 5489). English thug was taken from this family of words."
            }
